<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<title>Coming Soon</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%}
body{
  font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;
  background:linear-gradient(160deg,#eff6ff 0%,#f5f3ff 45%,#f8fafc 100%);
  color:#0f172a;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  padding:24px;
  text-align:center;
}
.card{
  width:100%;
  max-width:400px;
  background:#fff;
  border:1px solid #e8ecf4;
  border-radius:24px;
  padding:36px 28px;
  box-shadow:0 16px 48px rgba(15,23,42,.08);
}
.badge{
  display:inline-block;
  font-size:.7rem;
  font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:.5px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  color:#3730a3;
  background:#eef2ff;
  border:1px solid #c7d2fe;
  padding:6px 12px;
  border-radius:999px;
  margin-bottom:18px;
}
.icon{
  width:64px;height:64px;margin:0 auto 18px;
  border-radius:20px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2563eb,#7c3aed);
  color:#fff;
  font-size:1.5rem;
  font-weight:800;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(37,99,235,.3);
}
h1{
  font-size:1.6rem;
  font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:-.4px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
p{
  font-size:.92rem;
  color:#64748b;
  line-height:1.55;
  margin-bottom:22px;
}
.dots{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center}
.dot{
  width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;
  background:#c7d2fe;
  animation:bounce 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.dot:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.15s}
.dot:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.3s}
@keyframes bounce{
  0%,80%,100%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:.5}
  40%{transform:translateY(-7px);opacity:1;background:#4f46e5}
}
.foot{
  margin-top:22px;
  font-size:.75rem;
  color:#94a3b8;
  font-weight:500;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="badge">PrepExam</div>
    <div class="icon">PE</div>
    <h1>Coming Soon</h1>
    <p>Hum is feature par kaam kar rahe hain. Jaldi hi yeh aapke liye available hoga.</p>
    <div class="dots">
      <div class="dot"></div>
      <div class="dot"></div>
      <div class="dot"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="foot">Stay tuned</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
